# Day 29: the tuned local model for the RAG / trainer assistant (see docs/day29-local-llm-optimization.md).
# Create it with:  ollama create trainer-rag-fast -f rag/local-model/Modelfile
# The RAG pipeline sends its own system prompt, context window and limits on every call, so these values matter for clients that talk to Ollama
# directly (curl, the private gateway, a phone chat): an 8K window (the measured prompts are 0.1-2.1K tokens), calmer sampling than Gemma's default (1.0).
FROM gemma4:26b-a4b-it-qat
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
SYSTEM """You are a knowledgeable, concise personal trainer. Answer the user's question about training, nutrition and recovery."""
